        "Surah al-Ikhlas" to "Surah al-Ikhlas",
        "Say: He is Allah, the One. Allah, the Self-Sufficient on whom all depend. He begets not, nor was He begotten, and there is none equal to Him." to "Sema: Yeye ni Mwenyezi Mungu Mmoja. Mwenyezi Mungu, Mwenye kujitosha ambaye wote wanamtegemea. Hakuzaa, wala hakuzaliwa, na hakuna anayelingana Naye.",
        "Surah al-Falaq" to "Surah al-Falaq",
        "Say: I seek refuge with the Lord of daybreak, from the evil of what He has created, from the evil of the darkness when it settles, from the evil of those who blow on knots, and from the evil of an envier when he envies." to "Sema: Najikinga kwa Mola Mlezi wa mapambazuko, na shari ya alichokiumba, na shari ya giza linapotua, na shari ya wapiga mafundo, na shari ya husuda anapohusudu.",
        "Surah an-Nas" to "Surah an-Nas",
        "Say: I seek refuge with the Lord of mankind, the King of mankind, the God of mankind, from the evil of the whisperer who withdraws, who whispers into the hearts of mankind, from among jinn and mankind." to "Sema: Najikinga kwa Mola Mlezi wa watu, Mfalme wa watu, Mungu wa watu, na shari ya mnong'ono anayejitenga, anayetia wasiwasi katika nyoyo za watu, miongoni mwa majini na watu.",
        "O Allah, we seek Your help and Your forgiveness; we believe in You and rely on You; we praise You with all good, we thank You and are not ungrateful to You, and we part from and leave whoever disobeys You. O Allah, You alone we worship; to You we pray and prostrate; towards You we hasten and strive. We hope for Your mercy and fear Your punishment; surely Your punishment overtakes the disbelievers." to "Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, tunakuomba msaada wako na msamaha wako; tunakuamini na kukutegemea Wewe; tunakusifu kwa kila la kheri, tunakushukuru na hatukufuru, na tunaachana na tunamwacha anayekuasi. Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, Wewe tu tunayekuabudu; Kwako tunakuomba na tunasujudu; kuelekea Kwako tunafanya haraka na kujitahidi. Tunataraji rehema Yako na tunaiogopa adhabu Yako; Hakika adhabu yako inawafikia makafiri.",
        "The wording recited in the Hanafi school." to "Maneno yaliyokaririwa katika shule ya Hanafi.",
        "If you have not memorised the Qunut" to "Ikiwa hujaikariri Qunut",
        "Qunut (Allahummahdini)" to "Qunut (Allahummahdini)",
        "O Allah, guide me among those You have guided, grant me well-being among those You have granted well-being, take me into Your care among those You have taken into Your care, bless me in what You have given, and protect me from the evil of what You have decreed. For You decree and none decrees against You, and the one You befriend is never humiliated. Blessed and exalted are You, our Lord." to "Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, niongoze miongoni mwa wale uliowaongoza, nipe kheri miongoni mwa wale uliowaneemesha, niweke katika uangalizi Wako miongoni mwa wale uliowaweka chini ya uangalizi wako, nibariki katika ulichonipa, na unilinde kutokana na shari ya uliyoyahukumu. Kwani Wewe ndiye mwenye kuhukumu, na hakuna mwenye kuhukumu dhidi Yako, na yule unayemfanyia urafiki haaibiki. Umebarikiwa na umetukuka Wewe, Mola wetu.",
