        "Istighfar after the salam" to "Istighfar baada ya salamu",
        "I seek Allah's forgiveness. O Allah, You are Peace and from You comes peace; blessed are You, O Possessor of majesty and honour." to "Naomba msamaha kwa Mwenyezi Mungu. Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, Wewe ni Amani, na kwako amani hutoka; umebarikiwa Wewe, Ewe Mwenye enzi na utukufu.",
        "Say Astaghfirullah three times." to "Sema Astaghfirullah mara tatu.",
        "Ayat al-Kursi" to "Ayat al-Kursi",
        "Allah — there is no god but He, the Ever-Living, the Sustainer of all. Neither drowsiness nor sleep overtakes Him. To Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. Who can intercede with Him except by His permission? He knows what is before them and what is behind them, and they encompass nothing of His knowledge except what He wills. His Kursi extends over the heavens and the earth, and guarding them does not tire Him. He is the Most High, the Magnificent." to "Mwenyezi Mungu - hapana mungu ila Yeye, Aliye hai, Msimamia kila kitu. Wala usingizi wala usingizi haumfikii. Ni vyake vilivyomo mbinguni na vilivyomo katika ardhi. Nani awezaye kumuombea isipokuwa kwa idhini yake? Anayajua yaliyo mbele yao na yaliyo nyuma yao, na wao hawajumui chochote katika ilimu yake ila apendavyo. Kursi yake imeenea mbingu na ardhi, na kuzilinda hakumchoshi. Yeye ndiye Aliye juu, Mtukufu.",
        "Tasbih of Fatimah" to "Tasbihi ya Fatimah",
