        "Subhanallah 33 times, Alhamdulillah 33 times, Allahu Akbar 34 times." to "Subhanallah mara 33, Alhamdulillah mara 33, Allahu Akbar mara 34.",
        "Janazah dua — adult" to "Janazah dua - mtu mzima",
        "O Allah, forgive our living and our dead, those present and those absent, our young and our old, our men and our women. O Allah, whomever of us You keep alive, keep him alive upon Islam, and whomever of us You take, take him upon faith." to "Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, wasamehe walio hai wetu na wafu wetu, waliopo na wasiokuwepo, vijana wetu na wazee wetu, na wanaume wetu na wanawake wetu. Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, utakayemuweka hai miongoni mwetu, mjaalie hai juu ya Uislamu, na utakayemchukua miongoni mwetu, mshike kwenye imani.",
        "Janazah dua — boy" to "Janazah dua - kijana",
        "O Allah, make him one who goes ahead to prepare for us, make him a reward and a treasure for us, and make him an intercessor for us whose intercession is accepted." to "Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, mjaalie kuwa mwenye kwenda mbele kutuandalia, na mjaalie kuwa ni malipo na hazina yetu, na umjaalie kuwa ni mwombezi wetu ambaye uombezi wetu umekubaliwa.",
        "Janazah dua — girl" to "Janazah dua - msichana",
        "O Allah, make her one who goes ahead to prepare for us, make her a reward and a treasure for us, and make her an intercessor for us whose intercession is accepted." to "Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, mjaalie kuwa ni mwenye kwenda mbele kutuandalia, na mjaalie kuwa ni malipo na hazina yetu, na umfanye kuwa ni mwombezi wetu ambaye uombezi wetu umekubaliwa.",
        "Dua of Istikhara" to "Dua ya Istikhara",
        "O Allah, I seek what is good from You by Your knowledge, I seek ability from You by Your power, and I ask You of Your immense bounty; for You have power and I have none, You know and I do not, and You are the Knower of the unseen. O Allah, if You know this matter to be good for me in my religion, my livelihood and the outcome of my affair, then decree it for me, make it easy for me and bless me in it. And if You know this matter to be bad for me in my religion, my livelihood and the outcome of my affair, then turn it away from me and turn me away from it, and decree for me what is good wherever it may be, then make me content with it." to "Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, mimi natafuta lililo jema Kwako kwa ujuzi Wako, na natafuta uwezo kutoka Kwako kwa uwezo Wako, na nakuomba fadhila Zako kubwa; kwani Wewe una uwezo na mimi sina, Unajua na mimi sijui, na Wewe ndiye Mjuzi wa ghaibu. Ewe Mwenyezi Mungu, ikiwa unajua jambo hili kuwa ni kheri kwangu katika Dini yangu, riziki yangu na matokeo ya jambo langu, basi niandikie mimi, nifanyie wepesi na unibariki humo. Na ikiwa umelijua jambo hili kuwa ni baya kwangu katika dini yangu, riziki yangu na mwisho wa jambo langu, basi niepushe nalo na uniepushe nalo, na uniwekee kheri popote ilipo, basi niridhishe nayo.",
